  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Bolisetti Nageswara Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 21 March, 2022 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh The Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No.1923 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed under Section 482 Cr.P.C. seeking to quash the FIR in Crime No.201/2021 of Atmakur Police Station, SPSR Nellore District, registered for the offences under Sections 272 and 273 of IPC and Sections 59(i) of Food Safety and Standard Act.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter in view of the earlier orders passed by this Court in Crl.P.Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch and Crl.P.Nos.2966 of 2021 and batch, whereby this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several FIRs registered for the similar offences based on identical facts. Therefore, the petitioners are similarly placed and they are also entitled for quash of the FIRs registered and charge sheet filed against the petitioners.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter in view of the earlier orders passed by this Court in Crl.P.Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch and Crl.P.Nos.2966 of 2021 and batch, whereby this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several FIRs registered for the similar offences based on identical facts. Therefore, the petitioners are similarly placed and they are also entitled for quash of the FIRs registered and charge sheet filed against the petitioners.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
